// Ch10: a name-carver (she carves the name-shells; "Shell-carver" is out: ADR 0202 retired Shell as a status name). The name goes inside the shell (N-27: a name, not a keepsake).
title: ch10_bark_kirru_shellcarver
location: ch10/reedhollow
---
Kirru as "Name-carver" [neutral]: The name goes on the inside. Against the throat. You hear it with your skin. #line:ch10_bark_carver_001
<<if $ch10_heard_ressa>>
    Kirru as "Name-carver" [sad]: I scraped one blank, long ago, before my crest was white. I was asked to. My hands remember it. #line:ch10_bark_carver_002
<<endif>>
